  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Feuding mountain clans whose pride is matched only by their memory for injury and obligation.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Grendovar hold steep valleys in a patchwork of keeps, shrines, and bridge-tolls claimed by blood right and defended with crossbow fire. Their elders preach independence from every distant crown, yet no Grendovar is truly alone while the clan dead are remembered. Hospitality is sparse, vengeance is meticulous, and a forged oath may outlast the wall it was sworn upon."
